      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mb-4 text-white/90 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        If your washing machine does not drain, does not spin, does not heat, leaks, is noisy or will not start, contact RotoRem for in-home diagnostics and repair in Varna.
